# routine — a Meet routine opens narration on the person, where and when they are
#
# Opening a conversation with somebody teaches a Meet routine for their area and the hour. Walking it
# opens an ordinary narration session there — at that hour, past the walk — whose FIRST observation
# is of that person: the same opening focus a finished conversation uses (NarrativeController's
# opening focus), here set by the routine instead.
#
# The farmer roams; at noon she is in Test Wood. --npc-affinity keeps the conversation lawful and
# friendly. See routine_record_replay.cli for the Buy half of the same visit.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --npc-affinity CloseFriend --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Yard" --period noon --observe-only "Test Wood"

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60
strategy succeed

goal move
advance 12 180
click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click action 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180

# The second phase is clicked into: settle the word-vector load first, or which keyword it
# highlights depends on a race (see `wait embeddings`).
wait embeddings 60
observe farmer
goal propose_to_buy
click button
wait 60
advance 12 180

click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click action 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180

observe none
click button
wait mode WorldView 90
expect-state routines category=meet location=

travel neighbour
travel-go
wait mode LocationInteraction 120
advance 12 180
click button
wait mode WorldView 90

travel back
routines meet
wait mode LocationInteraction 150
advance 12 180

# Narration, in her area and at her hour, without the walk from the yard.
expect-state where Test Wood
expect-state where period=Noon
# And opened on her: the phase's first observation is of the farmer. Asserted by her persistent id's
# archetype prefix — the rest of it is her generated name.
inspect opening
expect-state opening focus=npc
expect-state opening farmer_
quit
